{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "The Reunion", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Remember That Time ... ?", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 3, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 18, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "A2.2", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Accurately use information about people's jobs and places of work in communicative situations", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn5le18ob03re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "What are Idioms?", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Idioms are expressions which have a meaning apart from what the words themselves mean.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "They are very common in spoken English. It is important to know some idioms and to remember that the meaning of the words as a group is different from the words individually. <br>Here are some idioms you can use with friends:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Idiom \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Meaning\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"A friend in need is a friend indeed.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"When people are in need, true friends will always come to their aid. \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Friends in high places\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Having friends in high places means someone knows people with power and influence. \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Be an item\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"When two people start a romantic relationship, they are an item.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Birds of a feather\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"As the saying goes, birds of a feather flock together, similar people get along well.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "How's life treating you?", "type": "name"}, {"content": "How are you? What's new? ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Long time no see! How's life treating you?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le18ob03aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to catch up with friends.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": " to steal", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to take something that does not belong to you ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You stole my seat.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le18ob03aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "whirlwind ", "type": "name"}, {"content": " busy experience ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I had a whirlwind trip around the world.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le18ob03aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "abroad", "type": "name"}, {"content": " overseas; in another country ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I had an excellent vacation abroad.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le18ob03aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to seem ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to appear ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The chair seemed to be free.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le18ob03aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "trusting ", "type": "name"}, {"content": " finding it easy to trust other people ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I used to be more trusting back in those days.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le18ob03aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Past Time Expressions", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use expressions like <span class=\"italic\">three years ago</span> or <span class=\"italic\">last year</span> when you talk about the past.<br><br>  You use expressions like <span class=\"italic\">in 2012</span> when you talk about a year in the past.<br><br>  You use <span class=\"italic\">When I was \u2026 </span> to talk about a period of time.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Expression \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" in \u2026 (month or year)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I went to Paris in 2012.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" last \u2026 (day, month, time, etc.) \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> He ripped the jacket last year.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"(number of months or years) \u2026 ago\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I bought this jacket 2 months ago.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Read each situation.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Choose one and role-play the situation with a partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Change roles and practice again.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":1,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Role 1</span>: You are walking on the street when you see an old friend. Say hello and update them about your life.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"c