", "contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self-Assessment.", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 11, "stimuli_ids": []}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn5le18ob03re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le18ob03re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn5le18ob03re2img05.jpg", "text": "", "time": "0", "id": 0}, {"image": "engenn5le18ob03re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Peter! Hey! <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Sally! Vanessa! My friends! How are you guys doing? Long time no see. You both look great.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: So good to see you, Pete. You look good, too. How's life treating you?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Oh, you know. Busy with work and stuff. Let's not talk about my boring life ... what's new with you guys?", "time": "2000", "id": 1}, {"image": "engenn5le18ob03re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I came back last month from my whirlwind trip abroad. Oh, that reminds me ... this is for you.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Oh, hey it's just like that jacket I ripped.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Yeah, it's a French designer!", "time": "23500", "id": 2}, {"image": "engenn5le18ob03re2img06.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Thanks, Sal. It's super nice. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: A friend in need is a friend indeed.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Weren't you wearing it when we met at Ned's Cafe?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Oh yeah. I was studying when you came in and stole the seat next to me. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I didn't take it. You offered it to me!", "time": "36000", "id": 3}, {"image": "engenn5le18ob03re2img06.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: That's what it seemed like. I was just being polite. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I used to be more trusting back in those days ... I don't think I would do that now. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Sure, V. I'm sure Marco would disagree with that.", "time": "53000", "id": 4}]}}], "_data": []}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "id": 0}], "type": "sena"}